+parity_meanings:
+  Parallel: same arithmetic, same result on every surface (one constants file)
+  Conditional: same result when the stated condition holds (the sync exists, the property exists, the same snapshot)
+  Divergent: different mechanism (snapshot / daily / event); the gold table and the write-back make the outcome equivalent
